* The self-cycling airlock (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our own script).
* Run by openc2e after the world loads (Additions folder); safe to repeat.
*
* The east sea's seabed (rooms 150-153) ends at x 6391 in a drop into the
* deep column (room 123, x 6060-6391, y 914-1470). From the bottom of that
* column the only way on is the round sea door (2 9 7, rooms 123/154) into
* the airlock chamber (room 154, x 6391-6722, y 1175-1470); the land door
* (2 9 8, rooms 154/155) opens only when the airlock runs its cycle (shut
* the sea door, drain with 2 3 4, open the land door). Creatures that went
* in drowned there (owner, 2026-11-10: option 1, "self-cycling airlock").
*
* A watcher (2 1 148, invisible) looks every 2 s, using the airlock's own
* door scripts, as a creature pressing the door would:
* - a live creature in the chamber, land door shut: activate the land door
*   (shuts the sea door, drains, opens the land door);
* - otherwise, a live creature at the bottom of the column, sea door shut:
*   activate the sea door (shuts the land door, floods, opens the sea door),
*   so it can come in and be let out on the land side.
* The chamber has priority: nothing is flooded while a creature is in it.
* After acting, the watcher waits 8 s (the cycle takes about 3 s).
*
* While the submarine (3 1 2) travels to or from the airlock, the watcher
* leaves creatures be and holds the airlock open to the sea, flooded, with
* the land door shut (owner, 2026-11-24: creatures in the chamber had it
* drained and the sea door shut as the submarine came, so it went in
* through the shut sea door, into an airlock open to land). The trip is
* known by the doors: the submarine's trip makes them unpressable (ATTR 4
* off) at its start, opens the sea door (which shuts the land door and
* floods), and makes them pressable again on arriving, then cycles the
* land door (drain, open). The watcher waits 4 s at the start of a trip
* (OV01 1) for that first opening, then puts right one thing at a time
* (land door shut first, then the sea door opened), 4 s apart. It starts
* no cycle of its own for creatures while the submarine travels at all
* (the submarine marks itself unpressable the moment it is called, a tick
* or two before it marks the doors), so a cycle cannot begin just as the
* submarine sets off and keep the airlock drained as it comes. A trip
* away from the airlock (its OV00 1 until it docks elsewhere) is held only
* until the submarine is out of the chamber (its right edge west of the
* sea door, x 6391); after that creatures left in the chamber are let out
* as usual.
enum 2 1 148 kill targ next
inst new: simp blnk 1 0 0 0 setv cls2 2 1 148 setv attr 16 mvto 5000 1320 tick 20 slow
scrp 2 1 148 9
  doif ov00 gt 0 subv ov00 1 stop endi
  setv var5 0 setv var8 0
  enum 2 9 7 setv var6 attr andv var6 4 doif var6 eq 0 setv var5 1 endi next
  enum 3 1 2
    setv var6 attr andv var6 4
    doif var6 eq 0
      doif ov00 ne 1 or posr gt 6391 setv var8 1 endi
    endi
  next
  targ ownr
  doif var8 eq 1
    doif var5 eq 1
      doif ov01 eq 0 setv ov01 1 setv ov00 2 stop endi
      setv var7 0
      enum 2 9 8 doif ov00 eq 0 mesg writ targ 0 setv var7 1 endi next
      doif var7 eq 0
        enum 2 9 7 doif ov00 eq 1 mesg writ targ 0 setv var7 1 endi next
      endi
      targ ownr
      doif var7 eq 1 setv ov00 2 endi
    endi
    stop
  endi
  setv ov01 0
  setv var0 0 setv var1 0 setv var2 0
  enum 4 0 0
    doif dead eq 0
      doif posx gt 6391 doif posx lt 6722 doif posb gt 1175 doif posb lt 1480 setv var0 1 endi endi endi endi
      doif posx gt 6060 doif posx le 6391 doif posb gt 1300 doif posb lt 1480 setv var1 1 endi endi endi endi
    endi
  next
  doif var0 eq 1
    enum 2 9 8 doif ov00 eq 1 mesg writ targ 0 setv var2 1 endi next
  else
    doif var1 eq 1
      enum 2 9 7 doif ov00 eq 1 mesg writ targ 0 setv var2 1 endi next
    endi
  endi
  targ ownr
  doif var2 eq 1 setv ov00 4 endi
endm

* The doors (2 9 7, 2 9 8) stay at their own plane, 1000, behind creatures:
* briefly set in front of them (3000) on 2026-11-13, then the owner asked
* for them behind creatures again.
enum 2 9 7 plne 1000 next
enum 2 9 8 plne 1000 next
